.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt LIBC 7
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm libc
.Nd the RavenBSD C library
.Sh SYNOPSIS
Static link:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
cc program.c -lc
.Ed
.Pp
Dynamic link:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
cc program.c -lc
.Ed
.Pp
The static archive is
.Pa /usr/lib/libc.a ;
the shared object is
.Pa /lib/libc.so.1 .
The stub libraries are
.Fl lm ,
.Fl lpthread ,
.Fl ldl ,
.Fl lrt ,
.Fl lutil ,
.Fl lresolv
and
.Fl lcrypt .
.Sh DESCRIPTION
ravenlibc is one source tree and one ABI for the RavenBSD shell, the system servers and the
base utilities.
The source is compiled into a static archive and a shared object with the same public names.
.Pp
The ABI has four rings.
Ring 0 is the stable POSIX and C base.
Ring 1 adds the BSD and Linux interfaces the project needs.
Ring 2 is the Raven extension API and the compatibility layer.
Ring 3 is stubbed or unsupported and may return an honest error.
.Pp
The library provides the Linux, BSD and Solaris personalities.
The selected personality is a runtime property; it does not change the ABI.
.Pp
Public symbols carry the RAVEN_1.0 version.
Private symbols carry RAVENprivate_1.0 and are not part of the stable interface.
.Pp
The hardened allocator is the default.
A tiny allocator is available for constrained builds; it is not part of the default shared
library.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width RAVEN_FDSAN -compact
.It Ev TZ
The time-zone name.
.It Ev LANG , Ev LC_*
The locale names.
Only C, POSIX, C.UTF-8 and names ending in .UTF-8 or .utf8 select UTF-8; other names map to
C.UTF-8.
.It Ev MALLOC_OPTIONS
Allocator tuning and junk filling.
.It Ev RAVEN_FDSAN
The file-descriptor sanitizer mode.
.It Ev LD_LIBRARY_PATH
The loader's library search path.
.It Ev NLSPATH
The message-catalogue search path.
.It Ev RES_OPTIONS
The resolver options.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /usr/lib/libc.a -compact
.It Pa /lib/libc.so.1
The shared C library.
.It Pa /libexec/ld-elf.so.1
The dynamic loader.
.It Pa /usr/lib/libc.a
The static archive.
.It Pa /usr/lib/crt1.o , /usr/lib/Scrt1.o , /usr/lib/rcrt1.o , /usr/lib/crti.o , /usr/lib/crtn.o
The startup objects.
.It Pa /usr/include
The public headers.
.It Pa /etc/passwd , /etc/group , /etc/hosts , /etc/resolv.conf , /etc/nsswitch.conf , /etc/services , /etc/protocols
The system databases.
.It Pa /usr/share/zoneinfo
The time-zone database.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dlopen 3 ,
.Xr malloc 3 ,
.Xr open 3 ,
.Xr printf 3 ,
.Xr pthread_create 3 ,
.Xr setlocale 3 ,
.Xr sysconf 3
.Sh STANDARDS
ISO C23 and POSIX.1-2024 base and XSI, with the BSD and Linux extensions documented per page.
.Sh HISTORY
ravenlibc first shipped in the RavenBSD 0.1 development tree in 2026.
